_mint - dispatches the ownership update to the raffle override.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:497 Raffle._update - checks the prospective nonzero owner through _isProtocolDestination.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:593 Raffle._isProtocolDestination - identifies the clone, factory, quote token, wrapper, prize token, implementation, and registered same-factory raffles.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:499 Raffle._update - reverts UnsafeProtocolDestination for a matching recipient.\"\n      ],\n      \"flow_terminal_action\": \"Reject ticket minting and roll back the nested purchase's USDC transfer and accounting.\",\n      \"flow_file_path\": \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\n      \"flow_line\": 498,\n      \"flow_input_to_sink\": \"The callback purchaser's recipient reaches the ticket ownership sink after payment and accounting, where it is screened against protocol addresses and registry state.\",\n      \"flow_security_relevance\": \"Protects ownership of transferable bearer claims. Although this check follows payment, a mint failure rolls back the complete purchase; a prize contract may catch that failure and continue creation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"flow_summary\": \"A contract receiving a ticket from a callback-driven purchase is called synchronously and must accept the ticket; rejection unwinds the purchase.\",\n      \"flow_trace\": [\n        \"packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:128 RaffleFactory.createRaffle - the selected token activates the clone and triggers a purchase.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:235 Raffle.buyEntries - invokes safe minting after payment and accounting.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:287 ERC721._safeMint - mints ownership before checking recipient acceptance.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:497 Raffle._update - screens the recipient and delegates the ownership write.\",\n    