le.buyEntries - safely mints the ticket while holding the clone's nonReentrant guard.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/utils/ERC721Utils.sol:33 ERC721Utils.checkOnERC721Received - calls the recipient after it becomes ticket owner.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:93 ERC721.approve - the receiver can authorize an operator; setApprovalForAll at line 105 provides collection-level authorization.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:115 ERC721.transferFrom - the receiver can instead transfer the ticket using inherited ERC-721 methods.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:497 Raffle._update - screens the onward destination before delegating the transfer.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:216 ERC721._update - enforces owner/operator authorization and updates ownership; transferFrom also checks the supplied from address.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:133 ERC721.safeTransferFrom - an onward safe transfer additionally calls the next contract recipient's receiver hook.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:88 ReentrancyGuard._nonReentrantBeforeView - attempts to enter guarded raffle financial methods during the original purchase instead revert.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:129 RaffleFactory.createRaffle - successful ticket approvals or transfers can persist when recipient acceptance and final escrow checks pass.\"\n      ],\n      \"flow_terminal_action\": \"Persist authorized ticket approvals or ownership transfers during the mint callback; reject reentry into guarded financial methods.\",\n      \"flow_file_path\": \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\n      \"flow_line\": 497,\n      \"flow_i